    text: `(1) Many residents need a drill or stud finder for one afternoon, not for permanent ownership. (2) The library should pilot a small tool-lending collection funded by the friends group. (3) Borrowers would complete a safety acknowledgement, and high-risk tools such as saws would not be included. (4) Staff would record demand, damage, staff time, and overdue returns for six months. (5) The results would show whether a limited collection provides enough value to continue.`,
